### ============================================================
### BFF: Calendar subscription — iCalendar of the coming days (#2719)
###
### Read-only, no auth. The events from today for 90 days, at most
### 500, in the list's order. Takes the event list's filters, so a
### filtered URL is a saved search. An unknown parameter is a 400.
### The public URL is /calendar.ics with the same query; nginx and
### the injector forward it here.
### ============================================================

### Everything coming up, in English
GET {{bff-host}}/api/events/calendar.ics
Accept: text/calendar

### In German: /de/ links and German estimate notes
GET {{bff-host}}/api/events/calendar.ics?locale=de
Accept: text/calendar

### A saved search: jazz in Neukölln
GET {{bff-host}}/api/events/calendar.ics?genre=jazz&district=neukoelln
Accept: text/calendar

### One venue's calendar
GET {{bff-host}}/api/events/calendar.ics?venue=berghain
Accept: text/calendar

### A client's conditional poll: paste the ETag of a previous answer, expect 304
GET {{bff-host}}/api/events/calendar.ics
Accept: text/calendar
If-None-Match: W/"paste-the-etag-here"
